## Changelog

### 2025-02-06: Merged Text Generation + Image Analysis Into One Unified Tab

#### Files Modified:
1. **FlipPix.UI/ImageGeneratorWindow.xaml**
   - Added `ToggleRadioStyle` to Resources for the input mode toggle buttons
   - Added `QueueFlashAnimation` Storyboard to Resources for queue item added feedback
   - Deleted Tab 2 ("Image Analysis") entirely (previously lines 712-1079)
   - Replaced Tab 1 ("Text Generation") with new merged "Image Generator" tab

2. **FlipPix.UI/ImageGeneratorWindow.xaml.cs**
   - Added `OnAnalyzerQueueItemAdded()` event handler method
   - Subscribed to `_viewModel.Analyzer.QueueItemAdded` event in constructor
   - Added `using System.Windows.Media.Animation;` import

#### XAML Sections Added (New "Image Generator" Tab):

**LEFT COLUMN - Input & Settings:**
- Section A: Input Mode Toggle with RadioButtons for "Text Prompt" / "Image Analysis"
- Text Prompt Mode sections (visible when `Analyzer.IsTextPromptMode`):
  - Saved Prompts (ComboBox with Save/Delete buttons)
  - Prompt TextBox with example prompts
  - Generation Settings panel (Workflow, Aspect Ratio, Advanced Settings expander)
  - Action buttons (Generate Image, Add to Queue, Add to Queue & Start)
- Image Analysis Mode sections (visible when `Analyzer.IsImageAnalysisMode`):
  - Image browse/preview area with "Analyze Image with QwenVL" button
  - Analysis progress indicator
  - AnalysisText TextBox for editing the result
  - Generation Settings panel (Workflow, Aspect Ratio, Advanced Settings expander)
  - Action buttons (Generate Image, Add to Queue, Add to Queue & Start)
  - LM Studio Connection expander (Server, Port, Model selection, Test/Refresh buttons)

**RIGHT COLUMN - Queue & Results:**
- Text Prompt Mode sections (visible when `Analyzer.IsTextPromptMode`):
  - Queue Status Bar with processing progress and Pause/Resume/Cancel buttons
  - Queue Items List bound to `PromptQueue`
  - Queue Control buttons (Clear Queue, Open Folder)
  - Result Preview with Camera Edit and Video Generator buttons
- Image Analysis Mode sections (visible when `Analyzer.IsImageAnalysisMode`):
  - Queue Status Bar with Queued/Completed/Failed counts
  - Processing progress bar with Pause/Resume/Cancel buttons
  - Queue Items List bound to `Analyzer.QueueItems` with workflow badges
  - Queue Control buttons (Clear Queue, Open Folder)
  - Result Preview
  - Flash animation on `AnalyzerQueueBorder` when items are added

#### Visual Design:
- 2-column grid layout (48% / 52% split) within ScrollViewer
- Input mode toggle using styled RadioButtons
- Visibility toggles for all mode-specific sections using `BooleanToVisibilityConverter`
- Queue items display with workflow badges (Z=purple, Q=blue, K=green)
- Color-coded status: Blue=Queued, Orange=Processing, Green=Completed, Red=Failed

#### Bindings Summary:
- Text Prompt Mode: Binds directly to `ImageGeneratorViewModel` properties
- Image Analysis Mode: Binds to `Analyzer.*` properties (nested `ImageAnalyzerViewModel`)
- Input mode controlled by `Analyzer.IsTextPromptMode` / `Analyzer.IsImageAnalysisMode`

#### Confirmation:
- Merged tab ("🎨 Image Generator") replaces both "Text Generation" and "Image Analysis" tabs
- Input mode toggle allows switching between Text Prompt and Image Analysis workflows
- Queue UI is visible and functional for both modes with mode-specific displays
- All other tabs (Story Image Z, Story Image Q, Story Image F, Amateur, Camera Angle) remain unchanged
- Flash animation triggers when queue items are added in Image Analysis mode
